\section{The scenarios}
\label{sec:scenarios}

Each scenario is one thing that can go wrong in or just before a lecture, and is
named after it.  Its driver runs in the main thread until the time is up, while the
respondents go on answering.  \Cref{tab:scenarios} shows them together; the
subsections say why each deserves its place.

